### =======================================================
### AUTENTICAÇÃO E LOGIN (Etapa 6 - JWT)
### =======================================================

### 1. Login como Administrador -> 200 OK
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@helpdesk.com",
  "password": "123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
    client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token);
%}


### 2. Login como Solicitante (REQUESTER) -> 200 OK
# @name loginRequester
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@helpdesk.com",
  "password": "123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("requesterToken", response.body.token);
%}


### 3. Login como Técnico (TECHNICIAN) -> 200 OK
# @name loginTech
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@helpdesk.com",
  "password": "123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("techToken", response.body.token);
%}


### =======================================================
### USUARIOS (Users - Apenas ADMIN)
### =======================================================

### Criar Usuario Solicitante (Admin Only)
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Solicitante",
  "email": "carlos@helpdesk.com",
  "password": "123",
  "role": "REQUESTER"
}

### Criar Usuario Tecnico (Admin Only)
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Tecnica",
  "email": "ana@helpdesk.com",
  "password": "123",
  "role": "TECHNICIAN"
}

### Listar Usuarios (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:8080/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### =======================================================
### ATIVOS DE TI (Assets - Criação/Edição: ADMIN, Leitura: Logados)
### =======================================================

### 1. Criar Ativo Em Uso (Admin Only) -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NOTE-100",
  "type": "Notebook",
  "description": "Dell Latitude 3420",
  "status": "IN_USE"
}

### 2. Criar Ativo Inativo (Admin Only) -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NOTE-999",
  "type": "Notebook",
  "description": "Notebook Inativo",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 3. Listar Ativos (Qualquer usuário logado) -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}


### =======================================================
### CHAMADOS / TICKETS (Etapas 4 e 6) - CENARIOS DE SUCESSO
### =======================================================

### 1. Criar Chamado: INCIDENTE_SISTEMA (Requester extraído do JWT) -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sistema ERP fora do ar",
  "description": "Nenhum setor consegue emitir notas fiscais.",
  "category": "INCIDENTE_SISTEMA"
}

### 2. Criar Chamado: INCIDENTE_EQUIPAMENTO (Requester extraído do JWT + Asset Obrigatório) -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Notebook nao liga",
  "description": "Aparelho desligou repentinamente e nao da sinal de carga.",
  "category": "INCIDENTE_EQUIPAMENTO",
  "assetId": 1
}

### 3. Criar Chamado: DUVIDA -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Duvida sobre acesso a VPN",
  "description": "Como configuro o autenticador no novo celular?",
  "category": "DUVIDA"
}

### 4. Listar Chamados (Technician/Admin vê todos; Requester vê os seus) -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}

### 5. Buscar Chamado por ID -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}

### 6. Listar Chamados por Solicitante -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets/requester/1
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}

### 7. Atribuir Tecnico (Transita automaticamente de CRIADO para ABERTO) -> 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tickets/1/technician
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "technicianId": 2
}

### 8. Atualizar Status para EM_ATENDIMENTO (Apenas técnico atribuído ou Admin) -> 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "EM_ATENDIMENTO"
}

### 9. Transitar para RESOLVIDO com Solucao Obrigatoria -> 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVIDO",
  "solution": "Reiniciado o servico do banco de dados do ERP e liberada a fila de integracao."
}

### 10. Transitar de RESOLVIDO para FECHADO -> 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "FECHADO"
}

### 11. Cancelar Chamado (Requester pode cancelar apenas seu chamado com status CRIADO ou ABERTO) -> 200 OK
PATCH http://localhost:8080/tickets/3/status
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELADO"
}


### =======================================================
### COMENTARIOS / HISTORICO DE CHAMADOS (Etapa 5 e 6)
### =======================================================

### 1. Adicionar Comentario ao Chamado (Autor extraído do JWT) -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{techToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Verificamos que o serviço já foi restabelecido e estamos aguardando a confirmação do usuário."
}

### 2. Listar Historico de Comentarios do Chamado -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}


### =======================================================
### CENARIOS DE ERRO E VALIDAÇÕES DE SEGURANÇA
### =======================================================

### Erro 1: Login com senha incorreta -> 401 Unauthorized
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@helpdesk.com",
  "password": "senhaIncorreta"
}

### Erro 2: Requisição sem token em endpoint protegido -> 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/assets

### Erro 3: Requester tentando criar ativo (Apenas ADMIN) -> 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/assets
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NOTE-HACK",
  "type": "Notebook",
  "status": "IN_USE"
}

### Erro 4: Requester tentando listar usuários (Apenas ADMIN) -> 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8080/users
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}

### Erro 5: INCIDENTE_EQUIPAMENTO sem enviar assetId -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Teclado quebrado",
  "description": "Faltou enviar o ID do equipamento",
  "category": "INCIDENTE_EQUIPAMENTO"
}

### Erro 6: Vincular ativo com status INACTIVE -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{requesterToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Monitor piscando",
  "description": "Tentativa de usar ativo inativo",
  "category": "INCIDENTE_EQUIPAMENTO",
  "assetId": 2
}

### Erro 7: Buscar Chamado por ID Inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/tickets/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}